    {
      "name": "moe-grouped-gemm-fp4-weight-storage-gfx950",
      "description": "Store the MoE grouped-GEMM weight operand as e2m1 fp4 consumed natively by MFMA, then nonkdim=16 + XCD de-interleave: ~42x isolated on gfx950",
      "keywords": [
        "moe",
